auth {
  mode: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  # QuickJoiner API — connected flow (Bruno)

  An end-to-end runbook for driving QuickJoiner over HTTP: health → (optional) sign in →
  connect a source → sync & watch → query memory & graph → clean up.

  Select the **Local** environment and set `baseUrl` (default http://localhost:8787).
  Auth is OPTIONAL — skip folder `1-auth` to run in open mode; run it once to turn auth on,
  and the login request captures the bearer token into the environment for every later call.

  Streaming: `/api/chat`, `/api/scrape`, `/api/sync/{name}/logs` return Server-Sent Events —
  read `data:` lines until a `done` event. Everything else is JSON.
}
